      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kazi ya Paulo aho Thesalonike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo mmbeni wanidu, mwamanya angu kumchea kodu ndekorekoghe kwa duu anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hata ngera derepatireghe wasi, na kubonywa kiwiwi aja Filipi, seji mwawuyamanya; derekoghe na ngolo kwa Mlungu odu, kumchilia inyo ijo Ilagho Jiboie ja Mlungu dikitangalwa na ndighi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.16.19+ACT.16.20+ACT.16.21+ACT.16.22+ACT.16.23+ACT.16.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 16.19-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.1+ACT.17.2+ACT.17.3+ACT.17.4+ACT.17.5+ACT.17.6+ACT.17.7+ACT.17.8+ACT.17.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kushingira kodu si kwa makosa kungi, angu kwa wuchafu, hata ndekuko kwa mikalo anduangi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela sa iji koni dererumiriloghe ni Mlungu kukaia dafwane kujidwa ijo Ilagho Jiboie, niko koni dighoragha, si sa kuwiboia wandu anduangi, ela dadajighora kwa kum'boia Mlungu; uo umanyagha ngolo ra wandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu isi na jingi ndederetumieghe malagho ghesesea-sesea sa iji koni inyo mmanyagha, hata ghefinikira wusu ghungi anduangi; Mlungu nuo mshahidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ndederelolieghe wubaa kufuma kwa wadamu, ikaiagha ni konyu, angu kwa wandu wazima; hata ngera saki eredimikagha dilawie konyu sa wadumi wa Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela derekoghe wa mboa aghadi konyu, seji kuwonagha mleli ukiwilindia wana wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwa kukaia deremkundeghe inyo na ndighi, derekoghe tayari kuwaghana, si Ilagho Jiboie jeni jiekeri anduangi, ela hata kufunya marangi ghedu, kwa kukaia morekoghe wa zoghori mbaa kodu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo mwakumbuka seji dibonyere kazi kwa kusumbuka nandighi wanidu; derebonyereghe kazi kio na dime, eri disekechamlemera ungi onyu, ngelo dikimchilia ijo Ilagho Jiboie ja Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo mo mashahidi, na Mlungu wori ni mshahidi, kukaia tabia edu aghadi konyu inyo warumirii erekoghe ielie, ndicha, na isewadie ikosa jingi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu mwamanya seji deremshashireghe kula umu onyu, na kumkumba ngolo seji ikaiagha mundu na wana wake; dikimlaghira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu mkaie na irangi jim'boiagha Mlungu, uo ummbangagha inyo andenyi ya Wuzuri na wubaa ghwake moni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni dadamfunyira Mlungu chawucha kwa wundu ughu, kukaia, mwendajiwusa ilagho ja Mlungu, ijo morejisikireghe kufuma kodu, morejirumirieghe; si sa ilagho ja wadamu anduangi, ela morejirumirieghe sa iji koni jiko ilagho ja Mlungu, ijo jibonyagha kazi andenyi konyu inyo warumirii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo wanidu moofwanana na makanisa gha Mlungu ghiko andenyi ya Kristo aja Judea; angu morejishiroghe wasi ni wamzenyu weni, sa iji koni awo wa Judea werejishiroghe wasi ni Wayahudi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
